{"seq":1,"slug":"coverage-transit-cost-model","title":"覆盖时效与物流成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/coverage-cost-tradeoff/coverage-transit-cost-model","wordCount":2577,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"覆盖时效与物流成本模型\">覆盖时效与物流成本模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-平均时效为什么无用\">核心概念：平均时效为什么无用</h2><p>一个仓覆盖一片区域，最直觉的度量是「从出库到签收平均几天」。但这个数字在决策里几乎没有用，原因有两个。第一，买家的体验由分布而非均值决定——平均 3 天但 10% 的订单走 9 天，和一个平均 3.4 天但 95% 在 4 天内的网络，对转化率的影响完全不同；跨境场景里时效分布是长尾的，均值会被少数跨境兜底路径拉高，掩盖大多数本地快速履约的订单。第二，均值掩盖了<strong>路线混合</strong>：同一个仓发往不同邮编区的时效完全不同，把城区与偏远区平均之后，得到的数字既不代表城区也不代表偏远区。</p>\n<p>因此覆盖模型的第一步是定义<strong>分层指标</strong>：按时效分档统计订单占比，而不是报一个平均值。常用的档位是「本地次日」「本地 2–3 日」「跨区 3–7 日」「兜底 7 日以上」四档，每个仓对每个目的邮编区给出这四档的概率。只有在这套分层口径下，「多覆盖一个邮编区值不值」才有可比性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单地址] --&gt; B[邮编区归属]&#10;  B --&gt; C{候选节点集合}&#10;  C --&gt; D[节点-邮编区线路]&#10;  D --&gt; E[干线里程/口岸/承运分区]&#10;  E --&gt; F[时效分布&lt;br/&gt;四档概率]&#10;  E --&gt; G[落地成本分项]&#10;  F --&gt; H[覆盖决策]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[边际时效收益 vs 边际成本]&#10;  I --&gt; J[覆盖率拐点]\">graph TD\n  A[订单地址] --&gt; B[邮编区归属]\n  B --&gt; C{候选节点集合}\n  C --&gt; D[节点-邮编区线路]\n  D --&gt; E[干线里程/口岸/承运分区]\n  E --&gt; F[时效分布&lt;br/&gt;四档概率]\n  E --&gt; G[落地成本分项]\n  F --&gt; H[覆盖决策]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[边际时效收益 vs 边际成本]\n  I --&gt; J[覆盖率拐点]</pre><h2 id=\"履约成本的分项构成\">履约成本的分项构成</h2><h3 id=\"六项成本与它们的驱动量\">六项成本与它们的驱动量</h3><p>跨境履约的落地成本不是「运费」，而是六项可分别建模的成本之和。把它们分开的价值在于：不同网络配置对每一项的影响方向不同，混在一起就看不见权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>驱动量</th>\n<th>对分仓数量 n 的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头程干线（进境）</td>\n<td>体积重、整柜/拼箱、批次频次</td>\n<td>每节点一批，随 n 上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口关务与税费</td>\n<td>申报价值、税则、递延资格</td>\n<td>与 n 弱相关，形式相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓储持有</td>\n<td>平均库存量 × 存储费率 × 天数</td>\n<td>随 n 按平方根上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓内操作</td>\n<td>件数 × 每件操作成本</td>\n<td>与 n 弱相关，规模效应下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端派送</td>\n<td>重量、分区、住宅附加</td>\n<td>随 n 上升（近端更便宜但件数摊薄）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆向与异常</td>\n<td>退货率 × 逆向物流成本</td>\n<td>随 n 上升（多点退货）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最容易被忽略的是最后一项。退货在跨境场景的比例远高于国内，而退货路径的复杂度随节点数上升：买家退回的货落在哪个仓、能不能在本地质检后直接再上架、还是必须集中到某个仓统一处理，这些决策会反向影响网络上「该有几个仓」的判断。</p>\n<p><strong>头程批次频次</strong>这一项受经典的批量决策支配：给定年需求量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、每次订购的固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>、单位年持有成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，使「订购成本 + 持有成本」最小的批量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^{*}=\\sqrt{2DK/h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = PD + K(D/Q) + h(Q/2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（Harris 1913 提出，Wilson 推广；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economic_order_quantity\">Economic order quantity</a>）。跨境网络的特殊性在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 里包含的不只是订单处理费，还有一整套报关与干线起运成本，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 远大于国内场景，最优批量也随之更大——这正是「宁可整柜慢一点，也不要频繁小批量空运」这条经验规则的数学来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分区费率与距离的非线性\">分区费率与距离的非线性</h3><p>末端派送的计价几乎总是<strong>分区制</strong>（zone-based）：承运商把目的邮编映射到若干分区，同一分区内价格相同，跨一区加一个固定档。这意味着「距离」在成本模型里是阶梯函数而非直线——把仓往前挪 50 公里可能完全落回同一分区，成本零变化；而跨过分区边界则成本跳一档。连续模型（见 <a href=\"../network-strategy-layout/region-warehouse-siting\">区域/国家仓选址因子</a>）假设的成本随距离线性增长在这里失效，正确的做法是把节点-邮编区的成本直接查分区费率表。</p>\n<p>一个可实现的建模方式是把「节点 → 邮编区」作为最小分析单元，每条线路记录时效与成本两个分布：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lane&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;node_id&quot;: &quot;US-LAX-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;postal_prefix&quot;: &quot;90-93&quot;,&#10;    &quot;zone&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;transit_days_p50&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;transit_days_p90&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;transit_days_p99&quot;: 7,&#10;    &quot;cost_components&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;linehaul_per_pkg&quot;: 0.42,&#10;      &quot;warehouse_handling_per_pkg&quot;: 1.85,&#10;      &quot;lastmile_per_pkg&quot;: 4.3,&#10;      &quot;returns_allowance_per_pkg&quot;: 0.31&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;capacity&quot;: { &quot;daily_orders_max&quot;: 4200, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;orders/day&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lane\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"node_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-LAX-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"postal_prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"90-93\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"zone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transit_days_p50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transit_days_p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transit_days_p99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cost_components\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"linehaul_per_pkg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"warehouse_handling_per_pkg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"lastmile_per_pkg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"returns_allowance_per_pkg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.31</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"capacity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"daily_orders_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders/day\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份结构里 <code>transit_days_p50/p90/p99</code> 三个分位数比一个均值有用得多：分仓决策真正关心的是 p90（承诺时效通常按 p90 附近设定）与 p99（异常兜底路径），p50 只用于展示。<code>capacity</code> 字段把线路与产能绑定，是第二章第 2 篇（产能与峰值规划）的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖的边际分析\">覆盖的边际分析</h2><h3 id=\"从总成本到边际成本\">从总成本到边际成本</h3><p>「仓越多越好」这个直觉之所以危险，是因为它比较的是总数而不是边际量。正确的判定是：<strong>把一个邮编区从「远端覆盖」改为「近端覆盖」所增加的成本，是否小于它带来的时效收益的货币化价值</strong>。</p>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点下的总履约成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示时效指标（例如 p90 达标订单占比），则最优规模满足边际条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial S}{\\partial n} = \\lambda \\cdot \\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是时效的货币化系数——「p90 达标率提升 1 个百分点」值多少钱。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计通常来自转化率与客单价的联合分析，或用客服成本与超时赔付的下降来近似；它不是一个纯粹的技术参数，而是业务判断，必须显式声明并做敏感性测试（见 <a href=\"../network-simulation-scenario/scenario-sensitivity-analysis\">情景与敏感性分析</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么收益端是凹的\">为什么收益端是凹的</h3><p>边际时效收益递减有明确的结构原因。需求的<strong>空间分布极不均匀</strong>：少数城市群集中了大部分订单，而分散的邮编区只贡献长尾。当节点数从 1 增到 2，第二个节点可以放在第二大城市群，覆盖的订单量很大、时效改善显著；当节点数从 5 增到 6，第六个节点只能覆盖一个偏远区域，覆盖的订单量小、改善的绝对量也小。收益曲线因此是凹的。</p>\n<p>成本端则是凸的：固定成本线性叠加，库存按平方根（对总量而言是次线性，但对<strong>边际新增节点</strong>而言每加一个都要多备一份安全库存），同时新增节点使原本整柜的干线运输被打散成更小的批次（见 <a href=\"../network-strategy-layout/forward-stocking-deploy\">库存前置与分仓策略</a> 中的总量关系）。凹的收益与凸的成本必然相交于唯一的最小值附近，这就是网络规模的<strong>经济拐点</strong>——它的位置取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 又随品类与市场而变，这解释了为什么「几个仓合适」从来没有通用答案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[节点数 n 增加] --&gt; B[边际时效收益递减&lt;br/&gt;需求空间不均]&#10;  A --&gt; C[边际成本递增&lt;br/&gt;固定成本+库存分散+批次变小]&#10;  B --&gt; D[收益曲线凹]&#10;  C --&gt; E[成本曲线凸]&#10;  D --&gt; F[交点即经济拐点]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[拐点位置由 lambda 决定]\">graph LR\n  A[节点数 n 增加] --&gt; B[边际时效收益递减&lt;br/&gt;需求空间不均]\n  A --&gt; C[边际成本递增&lt;br/&gt;固定成本+库存分散+批次变小]\n  B --&gt; D[收益曲线凹]\n  C --&gt; E[成本曲线凸]\n  D --&gt; F[交点即经济拐点]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[拐点位置由 lambda 决定]</pre><h2 id=\"覆盖半径与重叠区\">覆盖半径与重叠区</h2><h3 id=\"覆盖半径不是圆的半径\">覆盖半径不是圆的半径</h3><p>「一个仓覆盖半径 300 公里」这种说法在跨境场景几乎没有意义，因为覆盖不是几何问题而是承运网络问题：一个仓能不能在两天内送达某个邮编区，取决于该邮编区是否落在承运商的某个分区的时效承诺内，而分区边界通常沿主要交通走廊而非圆周分布。把覆盖画成圆形会在两个方向上出错——高估了走廊方向的覆盖（实际更快），低估了垂直方向的覆盖（实际更慢）。</p>\n<p>实用的做法是<strong>按承运商分区反推覆盖</strong>：把节点所在位置到各分区的实测时效拿出来，把落在目标档位内的邮编区集合定义为该节点的「自然覆盖域」。这个集合通常是不规则的，且会和相邻节点的覆盖域重叠。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重叠区的处理\">重叠区的处理</h3><p>重叠区是分仓逻辑最容易出 bug 的地方。三个常见的处理目标互相冲突：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最短时效优先</strong>：把订单派给时效最快的节点。这会让少量节点承担大量订单，可能压垮其产能。</li>\n<li><strong>成本最低优先</strong>：派给落地成本最低的节点。这可能导致明明本地有货却跨区发货，时效崩坏。</li>\n<li><strong>负载均衡优先</strong>：按各节点剩余产能比例分配。这会造成同一片区订单走不同路径，时效不一致且难解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实践中的合成规则是带优先级的排序而不是单一目标：先按硬约束过滤（该节点是否有货、是否在产能内、合规条件是否满足），再在可行集内按「时效档位 → 成本」排序取最优，并用一个负载阈值防止极端集中。下面这段查询展示了这个结构——注意它在 SQL 里就把产能约束当成过滤条件而不是事后调整，避免「先算出最优再发现超产能」的返工。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 覆盖分配：硬约束过滤 -&gt; 时效分档 -&gt; 成本 -&gt; 产能上限&#10;WITH candidates AS (&#10;  SELECT o.order_id, n.node_id, l.transit_days_p90, l.cost_total, n.capacity_daily,&#10;         n.load_today, l.capacity.daily_orders_max AS node_cap&#10;  FROM   orders o&#10;  JOIN   node_coverage nc ON nc.postal_prefix = LEFT(o.ship_postal, 2)&#10;  JOIN   lanes l          ON l.node_id = nc.node_id AND l.postal_prefix = nc.postal_prefix&#10;  JOIN   nodes n          ON n.node_id = l.node_id AND n.active&#10;  JOIN   inventory i      ON i.node_id = n.node_id AND i.sku = o.sku AND i.available &gt; 0&#10;),&#10;ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;         NTILE(4) OVER (PARTITION BY order_id ORDER BY transit_days_p90) AS speed_band,&#10;         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY order_id&#10;                            ORDER BY transit_days_p90 ASC, cost_total ASC) AS rn&#10;  FROM   candidates&#10;  WHERE  load_today + 1 &lt;= node_cap * :load_ceiling_ratio&#10;)&#10;SELECT order_id, node_id FROM ranked WHERE rn = 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖分配：硬约束过滤 -> 时效分档 -> 成本 -> 产能上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transit_days_p90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cost_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">capacity_daily</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">load_today</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">capacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.daily_orders_max </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_cap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   node_coverage nc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">postal_prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LEFT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ship_postal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   lanes l          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">postal_prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">postal_prefix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   nodes n          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   inventory i      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">available</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         NTILE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transit_days_p90) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> speed_band,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                            ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transit_days_p90 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cost_total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   candidates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  load_today </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_cap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :load_ceiling_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, node_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>:load_ceiling_ratio</code> 是产能利用率上限（例如 0.9），高于它的节点自动退出候选——这条保护是防止「最优分配」在峰值时把某个仓压垮。它的代价是订单被推向次优节点、时效略降，这正是第 2 篇要展开的产能与时效之间的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时效必须按时效分档统计（次日/2–3 日/跨区/兜底），均值在长尾分布下会掩盖真实的体验差异。</li>\n<li>落地成本拆成六项分别建模：头程、关务税费、仓储持有、仓内操作、末端派送、逆向与异常；它们对节点数的影响方向不同。</li>\n<li>末端计价是分区制（阶梯而非线性），「距离」在成本模型里应替换为分区费率查表。</li>\n<li>最优规模满足边际条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial S/\\partial n = \\lambda\\,\\partial T/\\partial n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是时效的货币化系数，属于业务判断，必须显式声明。</li>\n<li>收益曲线凹（需求空间分布不均）而成本曲线凸（固定成本、库存分散、批次变小），交点即经济拐点，其位置随品类与市场变化。</li>\n<li>覆盖半径应按承运分区反推而非画圆；重叠区用「硬约束过滤 → 时效分档 → 成本 → 负载阈值」的排序规则处理，产能约束必须是前置过滤条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"覆盖时效与物流成本模型","id":"覆盖时效与物流成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：平均时效为什么无用","id":"核心概念-平均时效为什么无用"},{"level":2,"text":"履约成本的分项构成","id":"履约成本的分项构成"},{"level":3,"text":"六项成本与它们的驱动量","id":"六项成本与它们的驱动量"},{"level":3,"text":"分区费率与距离的非线性","id":"分区费率与距离的非线性"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖的边际分析","id":"覆盖的边际分析"},{"level":3,"text":"从总成本到边际成本","id":"从总成本到边际成本"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么收益端是凹的","id":"为什么收益端是凹的"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖半径与重叠区","id":"覆盖半径与重叠区"},{"level":3,"text":"覆盖半径不是圆的半径","id":"覆盖半径不是圆的半径"},{"level":3,"text":"重叠区的处理","id":"重叠区的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保税/自营/三方仓组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-strategy-layout/bonded-own-3pl-mix"},"next":{"title":"仓库产能与峰值规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/coverage-cost-tradeoff/warehouse-capacity-peak"}}